DTSTAMP:20260906T000215Z
CREATED:20260906T000215Z
DESCRIPTION:On May 7\, 2026\, MCCSC Board of School Trustees and MCCSC Administrators will host the 13th Annual Evening of the Stars at the Bloomington/Monroe County Convention Center. Employees who are making a positive difference in the lives of our students\, staff\, and community will be honored as we celebrate their excellence. This celebration will also be a part of our annual Retiree Celebration\, where our special guests\, the 2025 - 2026 Retirees\, will be honored for their service and dedication to MCCSC.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260906T000215Z
LOCATION:302 S College Ave, Bloomington, IN, 47403
SUMMARY:Evening of the Stars
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
